Original question ,
How to determine what RAID H/W (Model number ..etc) is installed on an
AS4100 DU4.0E and also what  level its configured to ?

Answers from replies,
1- If by shutting  system down to the console prompt type the following
command.
# P00 >>> show config |more
# show dev

2- If you can not take the system down you might be able to find out with
either
# scu show edt
# more /var/adm/messages

3- You can use /usr/sbin/sys_check to create a complete configuration
document for the system. See the sys_check manpage.
