destination for an Oracle export/import. So on each system,
/etc/fstab contains:

-s81920                         /mtmp   mfs     rw 1 0

So about 40 mb of space on each side. Then I create pipes
with

mknod /mtmp/exp_pipe p   (source)
mknod /mtmp/imp_pipe p   (dest)

