<P><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" FACE=3D"Times New Roman">I've recently been =
handed a short suspense project to collect hdw info on all our =
department's servers, some 300+, several of which are DEC boxes.&nbsp; =
One of the requirements is to collect processor speeds. On some of the =
DEC servers, I've found entries in the messages file that gives me this =
info.&nbsp; On others, I've used decevent to collect it but on a couple =
of the servers neither the messages file nor decevent get me the =
processor speeds.</FONT></P>

<P><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" FACE=3D"Times New Roman">&nbsp; Does anyone =
have another method of determining the processor speed other than to =
surf DEC web sites which I haven't time for?</FONT></P>

<P><FONT COLOR=3D"#0000FF" FACE=3D"Times New Roman">&nbsp; As always, =
Thanks in advance for any help you can give,</FONT>
